---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Badge from '../../components/Badge.astro';
import Card from '../../components/ui/Card.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="Terms of Service for Naruka AI Labs (orgs.social). Plain-language legal conditions governing site usage, demonstration environments, and intellectual property."
  canonicalPath="/terms"
>
  <div class="legal-page">
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container legal-container">
        <Badge variant="neutral" text="Legal Information" />
        <h1 class="legal-title">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="legal-date">Last Updated: October 2026 · Plain Language Terms</p>

        <!-- Advisory Notice -->
        <Card class="card-compact" headingLevel={2} title="Review Advisory:" gradient="primary">
          <p class="legal-advisory-text">These terms outline the conditions of using <code>https://orgs.social</code> and inspecting our technical research prototypes.</p>
        </Card>

        <div class="legal-body">
          <Card class="card-wide" headingLevel={2} title="1. Acceptance of Terms" gradient="neutral">
            <div class="legal-copy">
            <p>
              By accessing and using this website (<code>https://orgs.social</code>), you agree to these Terms of Service. If you do not agree with these terms, please discontinue use of this site.
            </p>
            </div>
          </Card>

          <Card class="card-wide" headingLevel={2} title="2. Purpose of the Website" gradient="neutral">
            <div class="legal-copy">
            <p>
              This website serves as the informational portfolio and technical presentation for <strong>Naruka AI Labs</strong>, an early-stage independent software studio operated by Prince Naruka. The site presents product architectures, development roadmaps, and contact channels.
            </p>
            </div>
          </Card>

          <Card class="card-wide" headingLevel={2} title="3. Prototype Environments & Demonstrations" gradient="neutral">
            <div class="legal-copy">
            <p>
              Certain software mentioned on this website (such as Setu and Field Book) are research prototypes:
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li><strong>Setu:</strong> Provides architectural demonstrations using synthetic, simulated records. It is not an official government service and should not be relied upon for legal document filings.</li>
              <li><strong>Field Book:</strong> The live demonstration prototype is hosted on Vercel for testing event workflows and certificate compilation. It is provided "as is" without commercial service level agreements.</li>
            </ul>
            </div>
          </Card>

          <Card class="card-wide" headingLevel={2} title="4. Intellectual Property & Open Source Licensing" gradient="neutral">
            <div class="legal-copy">
            <p>
              The code powering this website is open source under the <strong>MIT License</strong> and hosted publicly at <code>https://github.com/princeji2/naruka-ai-labs</code>.
            </p>
            <p>
              Separate product source codebases, system architectures, brand marks, and specialized algorithms developed by Naruka AI Labs remain the proprietary intellectual property of the founder unless explicitly open-sourced under their respective repositories.
            </p>
            </div>
          </Card>

          <Card class="card-wide" headingLevel={2} title="5. Disclaimer of Warranties" gradient="neutral">
            <div class="legal-copy">
            <p>
              This website and all demonstration materials are provided on an "AS IS" and "AS AVAILABLE" basis without warranties of any kind, whether express or implied.
            </p>
            </div>
          </Card>

          <Card class="card-wide" headingLevel={2} title="6. Governing Law & Contact" gradient="neutral">
            <div class="legal-copy">
            <p>
              These terms are governed by the laws of India. For any legal inquiries or questions regarding these terms, please contact:
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong>Prince Naruka</strong><br />
              Email: <a href="mailto:naruka@orgs.social">naruka@orgs.social</a>
            </p>
            </div>
          </Card>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding-bottom: var(--space-4xl);
  }

  .legal-container {
    max-width: 800px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }

  .legal-title {
    font-size: var(--font-size-6xl);
  }

  .legal-date {
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  /* Advisory notice (slot content) */
  .legal-advisory-text {
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .legal-advisory-text code {
    color: var(--accent-indigo-light);
  }

  /* One card per clause */
  .legal-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-xl);
  }

  /* Clause content (slot content) */
  .legal-copy {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .legal-copy p {
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .legal-copy ul {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 24px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .legal-copy strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .legal-copy a {
    color: var(--accent-indigo-light);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .legal-copy code {
    background: rgba(var(--black-rgb), 0.35);
    padding: 1px 4px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-xs);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }
</style>